# Reverse-engineering scratch: the Apple KDK binaries themselves are not ours to
# redistribute, and the fixup dumps are large generated intermediate files.
# The scripts and the *.symbols.txt / *.syms text dumps are kept.
macos/reference/thin/
macos/reference/__pycache__/
macos/reference/*.fixups

